Getting VMs
1. Get VM
  - Initial login via initial login/password provided in enterprise VM console
  - host content
  - add legal stuff (Accessibility. Imprint. Data Protection)
2. Buy domain name (namecheap or similar)
3. Register domain at Cloudflare (gives DNS servers, which need to be inserted at namecheap)
4. Create ticket for firewall rule that allows outside access (80+443) at TUD Enterprise VM portal
